{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p><p>北角春秧街近北角道一大廈中層單位，今日（11月16日）下午3時半左右起火，濃煙衝天，火舌冒出窗戶，多人疏散。消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊，並升雲梯灌救，未幾將火救熄。火警中暫時未有受傷報告，起因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：Lai Siuyib@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c72c20a1ac9c6c1170427aaebab64aa/2026-11/vlcsnap-2026-11-16-16h00m55s875.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為北角春秧街近北角道一大廈中層單位。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bee89402491c91aa14609819243c3255/2026-11/n1_0.png\"/><img alt=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fa88a53147eb52d69b0695259744c51/2026-11/n2.png\"/><img alt=\"消防拖喉灌救。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0e4d60e9355b41bba00704433ce72e4/2026-11/n4.png\"/><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯灌救。FB：Lee Sophia@北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28887860941ecaba4f5da18920f0847a/2026-11/907650701_4180432795592806_7652305573594729567_n_0.jpg\"/><p>火警期間，北角道介乎英皇道與渣華道之間全線以及春秧街全線封閉，同時春秧街站及北角總站的電車服務暫停，上址交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"現場為北角春秧街近北角道一大廈。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6b641395e73f6455f661b7ee5c9d513/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-16_at_16_07_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防一度升起雲梯灌救。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a48d87fb8cc396a0eb1ad3f7b88d46e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-16_at_16_07_53.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員協助街坊疏散。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b47bacbdc9c25f51eebcf46943e153f7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-16_at_16_07_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位被燒至焦黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e054f1f8ae55baee2122673898c69d73/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-16_at_16_08_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位被燒至焦黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/462c6d6697fc5a62ed48a901deedd187/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-16_at_16_08_03.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:35:44.037881+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:30:12.042814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:29:21.675465+00:00","content_hash":"8a9808e99fb1d2eca25a7cc7e6f2152c08418079082f960cd81c0eeb4a3d3df9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}